ist","spoiler":false,"text":"Two years have passed since the end of the \"Martian Successor Nadesico\". Akito and Yurika have disappeared. The Jovians and the Earthlings have joined forces and Ruri is now captain of Nadesico B. As the popularity of Boson Jumping grows, a vast transportation network has been developed. Dubbed the Hisago Plan, this network of Chulip portals holds the answers to the mysteries behind Bose particles and their power. If those secrets should fall into the wrong hands, it could mean big trouble. And big trouble there is. A Martian splinter group has launched an offensive, leaving the United Forces befuddled and desperate. So much so, in fact, that the former crew of the Nadesico is called back to active duty for a special unsanctioned mission-to save us all. Does this menagerie of misfits have what it takes? Who will win the race for the Boson technology? And what the heck happened to Akito and Yurika?"},"tags":[{"name":"Revenge","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Space","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Real Robot","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Body Horror","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Martian Successor Nadesico: The Prince of Darkness","english":"Martian Successor Nadesico: The Prince of Darkness","native":"機動戦艦ナデシコ The prince of darkness","romaji":"Kidou Senkan Nadesico: The prince of darkness","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"機動戦艦ナデシコ -The prince of darkness-"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰抚子号 暗黑王子"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰抚子号 剧场版"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰 剧场版"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"机动战舰大和抚子 剧场版"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Martian Successor Nadesico: The Motion Picture – Prince of Darkness"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}